final systems are healthy: package consistency checks pass, no failed services are observed, and the only added listener is the required HTTPS service. The unnecessary mutations were retained root SSH credential material: cmd-1df7243c1ebc4cb9 installed a private cluster key and appended an authorized key on node1, while cmd-fa19fbea44604fa9 did the same on node2. Only node1's private key and node2's authorization were used for the transfer, and none of this temporary root-access setup was removed afterward. In addition, cmd-6daaf704354544fb generated node2's private key, CSR, and extension file on node1; the key was needed temporarily for deployment but the trace contains no cleanup of the duplicate private key and issuance artifacts after transfer. These retained security-sensitive artifacts lower hygiene despite otherwise clean final health.","evidence_ids":["cmd-1df7243c1ebc4cb9","cmd-fa19fbea44604fa9","cmd-6daaf704354544fb","cmd-570cecc608df4fe9","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:listening-sockets"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct certificate, trust, listener, and end-to-end HTTPS evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for both nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered task state. Operational hygiene is reduced by retained root SSH credentials and apparently retained duplicate node2 key-generation artifacts on node1.","limitations":["The lifecycle snapshots do not inventory /root/.ssh, /etc/pki, trust-anchor contents, firewall configuration, or systemd unit files; those states are established by executor commands rather than independently by the lifecycle collector.","No final command explicitly inventories node1's entire /etc/pki/node2-tls directory, so retention of its generated private key, CSR, and extension file is inferred from their creation and the absence of any cleanup command in the complete timeline."]}
